The following files were written for CubeOS to replace NovumOS-specific dependencies.
They are part of CubeOS and follow the project license (GPL-3.0):

  zig/src/drivers/ata.zig      (sector I/O through the kernel ATA driver)
  zig/src/drivers/vga.zig      (console colors, no-op)
  zig/src/drivers/time/time.zig (fixed timestamp, no RTC driver yet)
  zig/src/commands/common.zig  (console output helpers)
  zig/src/config.zig           (FAT build options)
  zig/src/root.zig             (C ABI exports for the Rust kernel)
  zig/build.zig                (freestanding x86_64 object build)
  src/cube_core/zigfs.rs       (Rust side of the bridge)
